('sam-sheet-125-rulings-2026-10-24', 'decision', 'cpl', 'Sam''s Sheet 125 rulings: NC-2 counts from COCI once the guidance names the course, attested until then; he takes the MAP roles request himself', 'Sam, Open Asks Sheet 125, 18:12Z 2026-10-24, reviewed through 2, both his own call: card 1 name-then-attest; card 2 later, with his note "I''ll handle the request".', 'Card 1: the Chancellor''s Office guidance names the CPL portfolio-development course (a title beginning Credit for Prior Learning Portfolio); the COCI sync counts a CDCP course with that title chaptered in a CDCP program, and a college whose course predates the guidance attests its control number, which the sync confirms. Card 2: Sam takes the CPL Coordinator and Noncredit CPL Lead designations request to Pedro and the CSM team; the draft stays on the sheet, and no session sends or follows it up unless he asks.', 'Sam chose to count the noncredit portfolio course from the course catalog once the Chancellor''s Office names it, and will ask MAP for the two new roles himself.', array['implementation-funding','noncredit','nc-outcomes','map-users','map-roles','sam-ruling']::text[], array['docs/reference/lanes/implementation-funding.md','docs/reference/lanes/map-users-student-contact.md']::text[], 'Open Asks Sheet 125 replies store, https://claude.ai/artifact/5zqA3S25eECWH9NALZRamE, 18:12Z 2026-10-24', array['nc1-mirror-channel-countable-cabrillo-2026-10-24','map-cpl-coordinator-source-college-contacts-2026-10-24','sam-nc-cards-cabrillo-map-roles-2026-10-24']::text[], 'SkyMatilija-S468', '2026-10-24', 'verified', 'Sam (Open Asks Sheet 125, 2026-10-24)')
